    <string name="more_about">About</string>
    <string name="more_about_desc">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_text">﷽\n\nThis app is an ongoing charity (sadaqah jariyah) for the soul of my beloved father,\nMuhammad Abdel-Azim Morsi Salama — may Allah have mercy on him.\n\nWe ask Allah, the Most Great, to envelop him in His vast mercy, to make this a benefit to him in his grave and a light for him, to place it on the scale of his good deeds, to make his grave a garden from the gardens of Paradise, and to reunite us with him in al-Firdaws al-A\'la.\n\nقال رسول الله ﷺ: «إِذَا مَاتَ الإِنْسَانُ انْقَطَعَ عَنْهُ عَمَلُهُ إِلاَّ مِنْ ثَلاَثَةٍ إِلاَّ مِنْ صَدَقَةٍ جَارِيَةٍ أَوْ عِلْمٍ يُنْتَفَعُ بِهِ أَوْ وَلَدٍ صَالِحٍ يَدْعُو لَهُ» — Sahih Muslim (1631)\n\nRafiq Al-Muslim is your companion day and night: it reminds you of each prayer on time, keeps you company with the Book of Allah, and helps you remember Him. The app is completely free and collects no personal data.\n\nEvery dhikr you say, every ayah you read and every prayer you catch on time with this app — we hope its reward reaches him too. Please remember him in your duas.</string>
    <string name="licenses_title">Sources &amp; licences</string>
    <string name="licenses_desc">Content sources and font licences</string>
    <string name="licenses_text">• Quran text: the Tanzil project (tanzil.net) — Uthmani script, Hafs from Asim, copied verbatim without any change, matching Quran.com\n• Recitations, tafsir and the Saheeh International translation: alquran.cloud / islamic.network\n• Azkar: Hisn al-Muslim (hisnmuslim.com)\n• Hadith: the two Sahihs in full, and from the four Sunan only what Sheikh al-Albani graded sahih (texts and grades from sunnah.com via the hadith-api project)\n• Prayer times: Aladhan API\n• Mushaf pages: the Madinah Mushaf in the King Fahd Complex fonts (QCF), page layout from Quran.com\n• Mushaf font: KFGQPC HAFS Uthmanic Script from the King Fahd Complex — the same font as tanzil.net, unmodified\n• Interface font: Tajawal (OFL licence)\n• Recitation of Sheikh Yasser al-Dosari: everyayah.com\n• Iqama: Isha iqama at al-Masjid al-Haram — Sheikh Majid Abbas (archive.org)\n• Dua after the adhan: Sheikh Muhammad Metwally al-Shaarawy (archive.org)</string>
