    <string name="names_intro">قال رسول الله ﷺ: «إِنَّ لِلَّهِ تِسْعَةً وَتِسْعِينَ اسْمًا، مِائَةً إِلاَّ وَاحِدًا، مَنْ أَحْصَاهَا دَخَلَ الْجَنَّةَ» — Sahih al-Bukhari (7392), Sahih Muslim (2677).\nNote: the authentic hadith does not list the names; this well-known list comes in at-Tirmidhi\'s narration (3507), and scholars have discussed whether the list itself is authentic.</string>
